gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hello, children. Welcome.\pMy name is Professor Yew. I\noversee the POKéMON Training\pProgram here in our region.\pToday, the day you have been\nwaiting for is finally here.\pYou begin your first steps\nas POKéMON trainers.$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "Our world is home to\nremarkable creatures called\pPOKéMON.$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Some live alongside us.\nOthers make their homes in\pthe wild.\pThey are our friends and\ncompanions. Together, we\psoar above the clouds, cross\nvast oceans, light our\pcities, and make gardens\nbloom.\pPOKéMON help us heal the\nsick, create beautiful\pmusic, discover new places,\nand accomplish things we\pcould never dream of doing\nalone.\pAnd, of course, they love a\ngood battle!\pAs trainers, you will learn\nto bring out your partners'\premarkable gifts.\pThe places you discover, the\nchallenges you overcome, and\pthe victories you share will\nbuild the strongest bonds\pbetween you.\pA POKéMON journey is the\nbeginning of a friendship\pthat can last a lifetime.$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Before we begin, let's make\nsure your enrollment details\pare correct.$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Select your appearance.$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "And your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. Is that correct?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. Good.$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Please review your training\npreferences.\pThen we can begin.$"
